You learn to devote a portion of your attention to mentally swatting, grabbing, or otherwise deflecting incoming projectiles.

All projectiles targeting you have a [17%, 24%, 29%, 32%, 36% (TL1-5)] chance to instead target another spot within radius [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] and move [17%, 24%, 29%, 32%, 36% (TL1-5)] slower.

If you choose, you can use your mind to grab all projectiles within radius 10 of you and hurl them toward any location within range [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] of you, but this will break your concentration.

To do this, deactivate this sustained talent.
